{{JPExclusive}}
'''Kamen Rider Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating [[Shin Japan Heroes Universe Collaboration Event#Rescue! Kamen Rider Cat|Rescue! Kamen Rider Cat]]. It was added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 701
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Kamen Rider Cat
|name2 = Shin Kamen Rider Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Shin Kamen Rider Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Kamen Rider Cat can be described as a weaker version of [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] but with better range. However, the thing that brings it down from decent to bad is its Single Target. Single Target makes its Long Distance ability worse than useless, since it means it likely won't be able to take advantage of its piercing range. As previously mentioned, Courier Cat is a much, much better alternative.

